 "observations": [
  "col_left L1: the d of «de» and the m of «Gomera» are printed broken.",
  "col_left L4, L5: a speck after the comma of «II,» (L4) is not transcribed; the h of «baldach» (L5) is printed broken.",
  "col_left L7: the last d of «Bahrām-ābād» is printed with its bowl open.",
  "col_left L10, L33: a dot after «lacus» (L10) and a speck after the point of «221.» (L33, 0.8 by 0.4 points) are not transcribed.",
  "col_left L11, L12: «Bālā» is printed with both macrons in both lines.",
  "col_left L36: «Battān» and «Bittān» are printed with the macron over the a; the first t of «Battān» is printed broken, like an l.",
  "col_left L38, L46: the t of «Bayt» (L38) is printed with a broken foot.",
  "col_right L3: «بيرهجك» is unvowelled: bāʾ, yāʾ, rāʾ, hāʾ, jīm, kāf. The e of «Bīreǵik» is printed broken.",
  "col_right L4: «al-Bīrūn» and «an-Nīrūn» are printed with ī (a bar over the i, without the dot).",
  "col_right L16, L17: a blank line separates the names in B from those in C.",
  "col_right L18: in «Afūmiyūs» the second letter is the italic f (with its crossbar).",
  "col_right L19: «Kahira» is printed without diacritics.",
  "col_right L26, L32: «Khalqīdūn» is printed with ī and ū in both lines; the q of L26 is printed broken.",
  "col_right L33: the first a of «Qāṭābāthmūs» has its macron joined to its head; in «al-kubrà» the k is printed heavier than the other italic letters, as on p. 360, and a speck under the r is not transcribed.",
  "col_right L44, L45: the corrupt Arabic form is printed unvowelled: «اطربز» (alif, ṭāʾ, rāʾ, bāʾ, zāy) and «مالياقية» (mīm, alif, lām, yāʾ, alif, qāf, yāʾ, tāʾ marbūṭa), the qāf with its two points; «طراقية» (L45) likewise; the question mark of L45 stands at the right of «طراقية», after a word space, and is followed by the parenthesis."
 ],
